WEBVTT

00:42.083 --> 00:45.378
SEPTEMBER 08, 2011
50 DAYS OF DATING

00:47.172 --> 00:50.300
Every now and then,
Yeon-su would ask me really weird stuff.

00:50.383 --> 00:51.760
You ever thought what'd happen…

00:52.594 --> 00:53.595
Hmm?

00:53.678 --> 00:56.306
Like, when I get into college,
but somehow you get left behind?

00:58.099 --> 01:01.227
- I will get into college.
- No, at this rate, I sincerely doubt it.

01:01.311 --> 01:03.104
Feels like that's
what you really want to happen.

01:03.188 --> 01:05.857
Relax, that's not what I want.
It's just a random what-if question.

01:05.940 --> 01:08.401
You'd take the exams again,
after I get in?

01:08.485 --> 01:09.944
Ever thought of that?

01:11.905 --> 01:14.157
First of all,
that's not even gonna happen.

01:15.283 --> 01:17.118
But let's pretend like if it does,

01:17.952 --> 01:19.913
then I'd just study
somewhere near your school.

01:19.996 --> 01:23.208
Every day I'll do my studying next to you,
with my own lunch.

01:27.754 --> 01:29.506
You really like me that much?

01:33.760 --> 01:36.262
Hey. I asked you a question.

01:36.846 --> 01:38.389
Hey.

01:38.473 --> 01:40.683
Just focus on sweeping, will you?

01:40.767 --> 01:44.938
- We're here to work, stop slacking off.
- I asked you, if you like me that much?

01:47.273 --> 01:48.358
- What's the matter with you?
- Hey.

01:48.441 --> 01:49.943
340 DAYS OF DATING

01:50.026 --> 01:52.695
- What if what?
- I was just wondering, what if…

01:52.779 --> 01:54.197
Occasionally,
she'd ask out of nowhere.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.406
What is it this time?

01:55.490 --> 01:57.367
What if you secretly went on a date?

01:57.951 --> 02:00.620
Don't be ridiculous.
Why in the world would I do that?

02:00.703 --> 02:02.330
Okay, then what if I do it?

02:02.413 --> 02:03.540
You're going on a date?

02:05.583 --> 02:07.210
I'm not.

02:07.293 --> 02:09.295
It's hypothetical.
It's just a what-if question.

02:09.379 --> 02:10.839
Ji-ung's gonna spy on you to make sure.

02:10.922 --> 02:13.133
He'll what? Yeah, right.

02:13.216 --> 02:16.386
I think I'll stick to you all day
just to make sure you don't.

02:19.889 --> 02:22.016
Okay? I swear, I'm being serious.

02:22.100 --> 02:24.853
I know you finish class
at 5 p.m. today. I'll see you soon.

02:24.936 --> 02:26.688
Even though we saw each other yesterday?

02:27.188 --> 02:29.649
You know, I'm beginning to think
you really like me a lot.

02:29.732 --> 02:31.359
Whatever,
class is starting now. Bye.

02:31.442 --> 02:32.569
Hello?

02:32.652 --> 02:35.405
750 DAYS OF DATING

02:39.450 --> 02:41.327
Looks like it's the end of the road.

02:41.411 --> 02:43.246
I don't know what's gonna happen.

02:43.329 --> 02:45.081
What if…

02:45.165 --> 02:47.584
What if what? Your fever went down.
Stop exaggerating.

02:47.667 --> 02:51.421
It's just a what-if question.
You're the one exaggerating.

02:51.504 --> 02:53.631
What if I never get better and,

02:53.715 --> 02:55.008
what if this is it for me?

02:55.091 --> 02:57.594
What? All right,
stop being ridiculous already.

03:00.638 --> 03:04.475
I suspect that Yeon-su enjoys
watching me suffer in agony.

03:05.059 --> 03:08.062
There. You're all better.
Get up and have some porridge.

03:16.613 --> 03:17.864
I just…

03:17.947 --> 03:20.867
It's just there was a specific answer
I wanted to hear from him.

03:20.950 --> 03:23.661
1,565 DAYS OF DATING

03:23.745 --> 03:26.122
To be honest, he was a strange boy.

03:26.206 --> 03:27.415
- Hey.
- Hmm?

03:27.498 --> 03:29.083
Are you all done? Do you wanna switch?

03:30.293 --> 03:31.753
I was just wondering, what if…

03:31.836 --> 03:34.339
- Again?
- Yeah, just a thought.

03:35.089 --> 03:37.508
Enough with your what-ifs.
I seriously don't care.

03:37.592 --> 03:40.345
What if I suddenly had to go abroad
as an exchange student?

03:40.428 --> 03:41.888
Did you… why did you sign up for that?

03:41.971 --> 03:44.015
I didn't. It's just a what-if question.

03:44.098 --> 03:46.100
That would be horrible.
Those things never work.

03:46.184 --> 03:48.186
In fact, all my friends
broke up after going abroad.

03:48.269 --> 03:51.272
At least, I could feel that
he liked me a lot more than he let on.

03:51.356 --> 03:55.068
What if I get a job somewhere
and they require me to move somewhere far?

03:55.151 --> 03:57.237
Then I'll… I'll follow you
and find a job there.

03:57.320 --> 03:59.572
Or at the very least I'll just follow you.

03:59.656 --> 04:01.074
Why?

04:01.157 --> 04:03.618
Why would you wanna be
by my side all the time?

04:04.619 --> 04:06.746
Aren't you tired
of our long relationship?

04:06.829 --> 04:07.789
Huh?

04:08.957 --> 04:11.084
Do you like me that much or not?

04:13.795 --> 04:15.046
How should I put it?

04:15.129 --> 04:17.799
He never said the most important thing,
no matter how hard I tried.

04:17.882 --> 04:19.300
Ow, hey, don't!

04:19.384 --> 04:21.261
- Fine, be like that.
- You don't have to be so violent.

04:21.344 --> 04:23.680
- Whatever. I'm going.
- Hey. Wait, wait, wait.

04:23.763 --> 04:27.100
Hey, stop.
What are you so upset about? Hey.

04:27.183 --> 04:29.644
- Hey, wait. Stop.
- Don't follow me.

04:29.727 --> 04:31.354
- Hey, wait!
- Why did she have to keep

04:31.437 --> 04:34.065
asking me that every single time?
It's so weird.

04:34.148 --> 04:37.110
Seriously, there's just no way
he can be that dense, right?

04:37.193 --> 04:39.362
1,670 DAYS OF DATING

04:39.445 --> 04:43.950
And then one night, finally, I asked him
that question for the last time…

04:44.033 --> 04:45.326
It's so peaceful.

04:48.288 --> 04:50.748
I was wondering what if…

04:50.832 --> 04:52.458
I thought we already banned that question.

04:52.542 --> 04:54.669
This'll be the last time.
I promise you. Just one more.

04:55.253 --> 04:56.921
I have no idea
why you keep doing this to me.

04:58.464 --> 05:00.842
What if someday we eventually break up?

05:05.555 --> 05:08.266
- Not gonna happen.
- It's still possible, though.

05:08.349 --> 05:09.350
Not for me, it isn't.

05:09.434 --> 05:10.685
- Are you sure?
- Mm-hmm.

05:11.853 --> 05:14.355
I mean I could maybe leave you someday.

05:15.565 --> 05:17.525
Like, what if I abandon you?

05:20.611 --> 05:23.323
It's just a what-if question.
I'm not saying it's gonna happen.

05:23.406 --> 05:24.949
Just wondering what you'd do.

05:25.033 --> 05:26.284
- I won't see you.
- Huh?

05:26.367 --> 05:29.746
- Ever again.
- Hey, easy. That's pretty heartless.

05:29.829 --> 05:32.457
- You'll never see me again, as in forever?
- Hmm.

05:32.540 --> 05:34.292
What if I find you again myself?

05:35.376 --> 05:37.962
I'll spray water, throw salt,
and then kick you out.

05:38.046 --> 05:40.965
Doesn't have to be that harsh.
I'm not a demon, you know?

05:43.509 --> 05:44.677
It'll be fine…

05:48.681 --> 05:49.766
just don't leave me.

05:50.641 --> 05:54.187
That was the first time
he ever looked at me that way.

05:57.273 --> 05:59.067
Looking back, I guess maybe…

05:59.859 --> 06:02.111
that wasn't really
a what-if question for her.

06:07.116 --> 06:08.076
You…

06:26.886 --> 06:28.429
And what about the salt?

06:29.347 --> 06:31.474
Seeing her here
right now in front of me…

06:32.683 --> 06:36.062
… just blows my mind.
How did we ever cross paths again?

06:39.774 --> 06:42.318
EPISODE 2
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

06:42.402 --> 06:45.238
- Hello, welcome sir.
- Hello. It's just the two of us today.

06:45.321 --> 06:47.281
I see. Of course. A table for two.

06:47.365 --> 06:49.534
- Hello.
- It may seem like a hassle,

06:49.617 --> 06:53.162
but I always stand outside to welcome
our customers and usher them inside.

06:53.246 --> 06:54.914
Many of them are regulars here.

06:54.997 --> 06:56.916
They're almost…
they're pretty much family…

06:56.999 --> 06:58.126
Hello, welcome, sir.

06:59.419 --> 07:01.295
Please, if you can just go inside.

07:02.255 --> 07:03.256
Hey, what's all this?

07:04.006 --> 07:06.717
We're filming right now.
It's okay, just act natural

07:06.801 --> 07:09.554
and pretend no one's looking at you.
Don't look at the camera.

07:09.637 --> 07:11.514
- Am I being filmed as well?
- Just act normal.

07:11.597 --> 07:14.058
Please, go inside now. Go on, sir.
Right there. Yeah, go on.

07:14.142 --> 07:16.853
Keep going and stop looking at the camera.
You're staring at it, stop.

07:16.936 --> 07:19.313
I guess you must be
a regular here at the restaurant?

07:19.397 --> 07:20.857
- Ji-ung, what the hell is this?
- Cut!

07:20.940 --> 07:22.525
Chang-sik, please. Give me a break.

07:22.608 --> 07:25.319
I'll explain it to you. Just think of him
as some kind of producer.

07:25.403 --> 07:27.405
Act natural and answer all his questions.

07:27.488 --> 07:28.781
Don't be weird.

07:28.865 --> 07:30.867
Pretend you don't know him.
Stop calling him by his name.

07:30.950 --> 07:31.868
Oh, I get it.

07:31.951 --> 07:34.579
- I'll just… I'll watch you do your thing.
- Okay.

07:34.662 --> 07:36.330
- Do what you need to do, don't worry.
- Good.

07:36.414 --> 07:37.540
- I'm cool.
- All right.

07:37.623 --> 07:39.709
- Fascinating.
- And action.

07:39.792 --> 07:41.461
- Oh, sorry! Someone man the counter!
- Excuse me.

07:41.544 --> 07:43.212
- Oh, what a hectic day.
- Coming!

07:43.296 --> 07:46.507
Hey, Ji-ung, where is Ung right now?
I could really use him around here.

07:46.591 --> 07:49.051
I told him to wake up early
and get here as soon as possible

07:49.135 --> 07:51.512
to help out at the cash register.
That brat.

07:51.596 --> 07:53.306
I think that
he has trouble sleeping these days.

07:53.890 --> 07:54.891
Why? Has he been sick?

07:54.974 --> 07:56.767
He's still struggling?
How long has it been?

07:56.851 --> 07:58.728
- I thought he's better already.
- Mm-mm.

07:58.811 --> 08:01.022
What's been stressing him out?
Is he eating right?

08:01.105 --> 08:03.065
Is he pulling all-nighters
because of his drawings?

08:03.649 --> 08:05.818
That boy! He never goes outside.

08:05.902 --> 08:08.488
Being indoors all the time
isn't good for your mental health.

08:08.571 --> 08:10.990
- Hey, Ji-ung, listen to me, you should--
- No, hold it. Wait.

08:11.073 --> 08:13.242
I'll do it.
I should buy some tonic for my boy.

08:13.326 --> 08:15.286
Honey, listen,
call Yong-tae and ask him to help us.

08:15.369 --> 08:16.329
He can concoct a tonic.

08:16.412 --> 08:18.289
- Okay.
- My goodness, you two.

08:18.372 --> 08:19.582
He's not a little boy anymore.

08:19.665 --> 08:21.542
He's a grown man
who can take care of himself.

08:21.626 --> 08:23.961
- He'll figure it out, you're overreacting.
- Shut up.

08:24.045 --> 08:25.379
Ji-ung, what's Ung up to?

08:25.463 --> 08:27.173
Tell me, what do you think
he's doing right now?

08:27.256 --> 08:30.051
Actually, I think he must have
just fallen asleep by now.

08:30.134 --> 08:32.428
I'll visit him after filming later,
then I'll tell you.

08:32.512 --> 08:34.555
Oh, thank you so much.
Yeah, do that. That'd be great.

08:34.639 --> 08:36.057
Yeah. Thanks, Ji-ung.

08:36.140 --> 08:37.642
- Okay, come here for a sec.
- Mm-hmm.

08:37.725 --> 08:40.603
Take care of everything here later
so that I can visit Yong-tae

08:40.686 --> 08:42.939
and ask him for the best tonic
he can come up with for Ung.

08:43.022 --> 08:43.898
And then we can visit…

09:02.917 --> 09:04.210
- How have you--
- How have you?

09:04.293 --> 09:07.296
I'm sure you didn't come here
to ask me how I've been doing.

09:14.470 --> 09:15.763
- You look--
- You look

09:15.846 --> 09:18.766
like you're about to tell me that
I look good, which would be a big mistake.

09:23.229 --> 09:25.189
Seeing as you're not getting upset,

09:25.273 --> 09:27.692
I guess this visit's gotta be
something really important.

09:27.775 --> 09:30.987
Amazing. How'd he manage
to become even more of an ass?

09:33.864 --> 09:34.782
You see…

09:35.283 --> 09:36.450
Hold on.

09:38.202 --> 09:40.913
Are you… are you getting married?

09:42.456 --> 09:43.416
No way.

09:44.542 --> 09:46.419
Okay. Fine then. Just keep on talking.

09:46.502 --> 09:49.213
Although, he seems
to have changed a lot too.

09:51.966 --> 09:54.093
That's you, isn't it?

09:54.176 --> 09:55.970
- No, it's not.
- You didn't even look at it.

09:57.346 --> 09:59.307
I can immediately tell you're lying.

10:00.016 --> 10:01.684
You're Go-oh, just admit it.

10:02.351 --> 10:03.894
- I said I'm not.
- To be honest with you,

10:03.978 --> 10:05.271
I didn't believe it at first.

10:05.354 --> 10:06.981
'Cause there's no way you ever
working this hard in your life.

10:07.064 --> 10:11.068
But the places you chose to draw
I thought they looked way too familiar.

10:11.152 --> 10:12.987
You don't go out much. Easy giveaway.

10:16.782 --> 10:19.619
- They look nothing special if you ask me.
- Plus, you had that interview.

10:19.702 --> 10:22.204
I remember that you once told me
that you don't ever draw people.

10:22.288 --> 10:24.290
It's pretty common for artists
not to draw any people.

10:24.373 --> 10:26.959
Fine. Let's say
these were just suspicions.

10:27.043 --> 10:28.169
This, however…

10:30.796 --> 10:31.964
is proof.

10:32.715 --> 10:35.468
NJ's manager posted this
on his social media recently.

10:35.551 --> 10:37.345
You see that blurry guy
sitting in the back?

10:38.888 --> 10:41.682
That's you
no matter how many times I look at it.

10:41.766 --> 10:43.267
You recognized me?

10:43.351 --> 10:45.311
Go-oh had a reputation
for being secretive.

10:45.394 --> 10:48.439
He never showed up to his exhibitions
or even when he sold his paintings.

10:48.522 --> 10:49.982
But he met NJ in person.

10:51.692 --> 10:54.737
- I'm her fan.
- Hm. Okay. Sure, you are.

10:55.571 --> 10:57.948
Anyway, I'm here to see Go-oh,
not Choi Ung.

10:58.032 --> 11:00.076
Strictly business. I have a proposal.

11:01.369 --> 11:02.411
Really?

11:04.372 --> 11:05.373
Hmm.

11:06.916 --> 11:08.000
Make your pitch.

11:08.668 --> 11:11.253
I guess
everyone does change with success.

11:11.337 --> 11:13.339
Look how cocky he is right now.

11:25.142 --> 11:26.560
Thank you for considering.

11:26.644 --> 11:28.187
Sir, our proposal is,

11:28.270 --> 11:31.399
we would like to do a collaboration
between Soen Shop and your work.

11:31.482 --> 11:34.235
It's a premium lifestyle select shop,
which would gel with your style.

11:34.318 --> 11:37.613
We were thinking as a surprise
you could do a live drawing session,

11:37.697 --> 11:40.658
as sort of a highlight event
during the opening day.

11:41.409 --> 11:43.536
Would you be amenable to this arrangement?

11:44.161 --> 11:45.121
No, thank you.

11:46.205 --> 11:47.707
- Sorry?
- I said no.

11:49.792 --> 11:51.752
May I ask if there's a specific reason?

11:51.836 --> 11:53.379
I just don't want to.

11:53.963 --> 11:54.880
But still,

11:55.673 --> 11:57.341
if you give us a reason
for your reluctance,

11:57.425 --> 11:58.968
then we can adjust our proposal for you.

11:59.051 --> 12:02.179
No. There's no need for any of that.
It's okay. Thanks.

12:02.263 --> 12:04.849
- Hey.
- Sorry, to whom are you speaking?

12:04.932 --> 12:05.808
The artist Go-oh or Ung?

12:05.891 --> 12:07.893
Are you gonna keep being childish
and get personal--

12:07.977 --> 12:11.063
How could you say that, of course I'm not.
That's why I'm hearing you out right now.

12:11.147 --> 12:12.773
Then why don't you like it?
Is it because of me?

12:12.857 --> 12:13.899
It's a perfectly good proposal.

12:13.983 --> 12:15.985
'Cause, I don't like
being in front of people.

12:16.068 --> 12:18.946
Which you'd know
if you did your research. By the way…

12:20.030 --> 12:21.407
Yeah, I guess it's also 'cause of you.

12:26.370 --> 12:28.038
I see you've grown quite a bit.

12:28.122 --> 12:29.582
I don't know.

12:29.665 --> 12:32.668
As far as I can remember,
I've always been a lot taller than you.

12:32.752 --> 12:34.962
Can you please just stop
being so immature about this?

12:38.549 --> 12:41.051
Anyway, if you could please
take a look at this.

12:41.135 --> 12:43.554
- And if you change your mind--
- Whom are you talking to again?

12:43.637 --> 12:45.848
- Go-oh? Or Ung?
- Hey.

12:49.518 --> 12:51.854
I swear
I should have never visited him.

12:51.937 --> 12:53.731
All he did was humiliate me.

12:55.399 --> 12:58.068
- What are you doing here, Yeon-su?
- What?

12:58.152 --> 12:59.820
I told you to stay away from me forever.

13:02.072 --> 13:03.741
I'm here
in a strictly professional manner.

13:03.824 --> 13:05.284
So just for work? That's all it is?

13:05.367 --> 13:07.119
Getting this proposal
is very important to me.

13:07.203 --> 13:08.078
I don't know.

13:08.162 --> 13:11.332
Doesn't seem important enough
to come find me after five years.

13:11.916 --> 13:14.627
How are you still so upset
even after five years have passed?

13:14.710 --> 13:17.338
How are you so indifferent
only after five years?

13:33.646 --> 13:34.855
What are you doing?

13:35.648 --> 13:36.607
Am I dreaming?

13:38.067 --> 13:41.070
'Cause unless I am, that woman
looks eerily similar to Yeon-su.

13:41.153 --> 13:42.905
Nice to see he hasn't changed either.

13:42.988 --> 13:45.449
What the?
She even sounds exactly like her.

13:45.533 --> 13:47.076
Wow, this is so trippy.

13:47.159 --> 13:49.954
I can't believe I'm dreaming of you
meeting your ex-girlfriend again.

13:50.830 --> 13:53.332
I think we're done here now,
you should go home.

13:55.793 --> 13:56.836
Despicable jerk.

13:58.796 --> 14:01.465
What the hell?
What's going on? Is this for real?

14:01.966 --> 14:03.759
Holy shit, what is Yeon-su doing in here?

14:05.719 --> 14:06.846
Come on. Get the door.

14:06.929 --> 14:07.972
Oh, okay.

14:23.362 --> 14:24.238
Who is it?

14:25.865 --> 14:28.868
All right, I'm definitely still asleep.
This is way too messed up to be real.

14:28.951 --> 14:30.870
- It's gotta be a dream.
- What the hell's wrong?

14:30.953 --> 14:32.204
This has to be a dream.

14:34.665 --> 14:36.208
- Oh?
- Good morning, it's nice to see you.

14:37.334 --> 14:39.712
It's okay. That's actually normal for me.

14:39.795 --> 14:41.255
It's been a while, hasn't it?

14:42.131 --> 14:44.091
Yeah, it has, but you didn't even call.

14:44.174 --> 14:46.302
You rarely pick up at this hour,
so I thought I'd just visit.

14:46.385 --> 14:47.887
- Can I come in, please?
- Sure.

14:55.978 --> 14:58.147
So who are all these people in your house?

14:58.856 --> 15:00.983
- Are these your employees?
- Yeah.

15:03.277 --> 15:04.486
I'm going now.

15:11.327 --> 15:14.288
Jerk thinks he can look down on me
just 'cause he's all successful now.

15:14.371 --> 15:16.290
Since when did he become
all high and mighty?

15:16.790 --> 15:18.125
Whoa.

15:25.382 --> 15:26.258
Good riddance.

15:34.099 --> 15:37.519
Well, that was satisfying.
That's one thing off my bucket list.

15:38.103 --> 15:40.606
How dare you show up here?

15:44.568 --> 15:47.071
What are you doing, man?
Don't keep her waiting. Go talk to her.

15:47.154 --> 15:48.489
It looks like you had
a guest over just now.

15:49.073 --> 15:51.158
Oh, yeah.
I wasn't expecting you to visit today.

15:51.241 --> 15:53.535
Actually, I was a bit thoughtless.
I'm used to being welcomed

15:53.619 --> 15:55.371
even when I'm not expected, sorry.

15:55.454 --> 15:57.331
Don't be sorry. It's all good, I swear.

16:03.504 --> 16:05.381
Hello. My name is Gu Eun-ho.

16:05.464 --> 16:07.299
I'm Ung's manager and his friend.

16:07.383 --> 16:09.468
Uh, you can ask me
if you want to purchase his work,

16:09.551 --> 16:10.844
visit his upcoming exhibitions.

16:10.928 --> 16:14.056
Anything related to him, you can ask me.
I'm the man you need.

16:14.139 --> 16:17.101
So it's Ung?
I guess that's your real name?

16:18.143 --> 16:20.020
Yeah. It's Choi Ung.

16:20.104 --> 16:20.980
Oh.

16:21.063 --> 16:23.899
I have to apologize,
did I come over too early today?

16:23.983 --> 16:26.026
No, not at all.
Feel free to come whenever you want.

16:26.110 --> 16:27.528
We're very accommodating to visitors.

16:27.611 --> 16:30.614
The studio's always open.
All year round, 24-7.

16:30.698 --> 16:31.532
Why would my studio--

16:31.615 --> 16:33.742
If you have any questions,
you can barge in whenever you wish.

16:33.826 --> 16:35.995
We'll unlock the door for you,
even at night.

16:36.078 --> 16:38.288
We're honored someone as shabby
as you came to this precious…

16:39.289 --> 16:42.376
No, you're precious. Someone as precious
as you came to this shabby place…

16:44.128 --> 16:45.629
I'm so sorry.

16:45.713 --> 16:48.382
Don't worry about it.
People often stutter when they talk to me.

16:48.465 --> 16:50.050
I'm used to it. It's nothing new.

16:50.134 --> 16:51.760
Can I have a tour of your studio?

16:51.844 --> 16:53.971
Of course, you can. Right?

16:54.054 --> 16:55.097
It's okay, right?

16:55.180 --> 16:57.850
Of course it's fine.
Right this way, if you please.

17:04.690 --> 17:06.775
I'm never gonna forget this day.

17:06.859 --> 17:08.652
Truly a gratifying moment.

17:09.153 --> 17:10.195
Are you okay there?

17:10.279 --> 17:11.405
Oh, yeah.

17:12.156 --> 17:15.034
- Thank you for the food.
- No, thank you for eating here.

17:15.659 --> 17:17.703
- Go.
- Your food is always delicious.

17:17.786 --> 17:20.581
Oh, my goodness, you're way too kind, sir.

17:20.664 --> 17:21.999
I hope you succeed.

17:22.082 --> 17:24.501
Thank you.
You've been wonderful. Have a great day.

17:24.585 --> 17:26.253
- Goodbye, sir.
- Goodbye.

17:26.336 --> 17:28.088
Just keep walking, sir. Keep walking.

17:28.172 --> 17:31.050
I was wondering, how come
you gave me a free fried egg today?

17:31.133 --> 17:33.218
- You don't usually do that.
- Thanks!

17:33.302 --> 17:35.471
Just leave. Go.

17:35.554 --> 17:37.514
Okay, my name is Ju Chang-sik

17:37.598 --> 17:39.600
- and I own Seoul Hardware--
- Yeon-su?

17:43.937 --> 17:45.355
You never even gave me a warning.

17:45.439 --> 17:47.649
How dare you let me look this ugly
in front of her?

17:47.733 --> 17:49.902
You did it on purpose. You traitor.

17:49.985 --> 17:51.195
I know I'm right. 

17:51.779 --> 17:53.989
This is a gratifying moment.

17:54.073 --> 17:55.908
So I was thinking…

17:55.991 --> 17:57.826
I had been waiting for this day.

17:57.910 --> 17:59.119
Excuse me?

18:00.579 --> 18:01.914
She's calling you, you idiot.

18:03.123 --> 18:04.083
Can you draw something for me?

18:04.166 --> 18:05.542
Uh, you mean…

18:05.626 --> 18:07.377
There's something specific
I'd like you to draw.

18:07.461 --> 18:10.339
Uh, I see.
Except, I don't normally draw people.

18:10.422 --> 18:14.093
I usually draw backgrounds
such as buildings or nature, like trees.

18:14.176 --> 18:16.136
It's a building, don't worry too much.
My building.

18:17.012 --> 18:19.264
- Sorry?
- I'd like you to draw the buildings I own.

18:19.348 --> 18:22.226
- Make them pretty.
- Wow. She's incredible.

18:22.976 --> 18:25.395
These days, I find it difficult
to derive joy from my life.

18:25.479 --> 18:27.856
Simply put, I'm always bored,
no matter what I do.

18:27.940 --> 18:29.817
When it comes down to it,
this isn't the reason

18:29.900 --> 18:31.944
- I worked so hard throughout my life.
- Oh, dear.

18:32.027 --> 18:34.154
But then when I look at my buildings,

18:34.238 --> 18:36.532
there's this indescribable feeling
that hits me.

18:36.615 --> 18:38.867
I guess you could say it feels refreshing.

18:38.951 --> 18:42.121
I feel more alive, I have an appetite,
and actually sleep well at night.

18:43.080 --> 18:45.332
Looking at them gives me
a sense of reassurance.

18:45.415 --> 18:46.792
I'm glad.

18:48.127 --> 18:50.462
It's the same feeling I get
when I look at your work.

18:50.546 --> 18:53.132
Oh, thanks.

18:59.847 --> 19:02.599
Looking at them,
I find peace and balance.

19:03.517 --> 19:06.937
Buildings they're the only things
in this world that remain the same.

19:07.521 --> 19:09.356
Do you also own any buildings?

19:09.439 --> 19:11.859
No, of course not. He's paying month--

19:11.942 --> 19:14.736
So what do you say?
Are you willing to draw one up for me?

19:14.820 --> 19:16.071
Think about it it'll benefit you

19:16.155 --> 19:18.031
if they find out
I bought another piece of yours.

19:18.115 --> 19:20.868
Uh, wait a sec. You think it'll be okay?

19:20.951 --> 19:23.912
I mean, you're an idol, so…
it could change your reputation a bit

19:23.996 --> 19:26.248
if people find out
that you purchased buildings.

19:26.331 --> 19:27.541
I don't care about that.

19:27.624 --> 19:30.711
Maintaining this pristine,
but manufactured image people had of me

19:30.794 --> 19:32.504
never brought me any joy in my life.

19:33.338 --> 19:35.174
If I'm gonna be happy, better start now.

19:35.257 --> 19:36.758
I'll do what I want from now on.

19:36.842 --> 19:37.968
Oh.

19:38.051 --> 19:40.679
Let me have a moment to think about it.

19:40.762 --> 19:41.972
It's cool. I'm sure he can do it.

19:43.182 --> 19:44.600
Oh, and I was wondering,

19:44.683 --> 19:46.435
didn't you say earlier
that you were my fan?

19:47.269 --> 19:48.770
Yeah. Yeah, I did.

19:49.563 --> 19:51.440
Well, it doesn't seem like you are.

19:52.107 --> 19:54.026
It's almost like
you're sick of me already.

19:55.194 --> 19:56.570
I'm not sure what you mean?

19:57.738 --> 19:59.573
It just seems like
you're a bit distracted today.

19:59.656 --> 20:00.782
I don't know what it is.

20:03.118 --> 20:05.370
I've got a knack
for noticing things like this easily.

20:06.538 --> 20:08.832
Oh, I don't think that's why I seem--

20:08.916 --> 20:11.168
It looks like I should get going now.
See you next time.

20:11.251 --> 20:14.421
Oh. Wait, let me walk you to the door.

20:28.310 --> 20:30.604
It's not fair.
Why does it keep bothering me?

20:35.108 --> 20:36.526
Childish little prick.

20:37.402 --> 20:39.238
I don't need him to do me this favor.

20:39.321 --> 20:40.948
I still have my pride too.

20:41.031 --> 20:43.700
I'm never gonna let him
humiliate me again.

20:43.784 --> 20:45.327
I seriously hope you weren't bluffing

20:45.410 --> 20:47.162
about getting the artist
to work on this project.

20:47.746 --> 20:49.665
You can't possibly
be that pathetic, can you?

20:50.999 --> 20:53.418
Oh, I shouldn't have overreacted.

20:54.670 --> 20:57.214
Should I let myself go
and beg him just this once?

20:58.882 --> 20:59.841
There's no way.

21:00.425 --> 21:01.885
The guy literally threw salt at me.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.811
What are you daydreaming
in the middle of the road for?

21:11.687 --> 21:12.854
Hey.

21:12.938 --> 21:14.731
It's a narrow alley.
You should be more careful.

21:14.815 --> 21:17.234
It's been ages, you know that right?

21:17.317 --> 21:18.819
What brings you all the way out here?

21:18.902 --> 21:22.489
I should be asking you the same thing.
What are you doing all the way out here?

21:22.572 --> 21:24.366
Oh, right. I guess you live here as well.

21:24.449 --> 21:27.452
Don't tell me you're here to see Choi Ung.

21:27.536 --> 21:30.205
Don't even get me started.
I came to see the great Go-oh,

21:30.289 --> 21:33.333
- but instead I got treated like a doormat.
- What do you mean?

21:33.417 --> 21:36.837
Is that guy ever gonna actually grow up?
He's become even more immature.

21:36.920 --> 21:40.007
Let me guess,
did he spray water and throw salt at you?

21:40.590 --> 21:41.883
How'd you know he'd do that?

21:41.967 --> 21:45.095
Because he practiced doing that
on Eun-ho more than 50 times.

21:45.178 --> 21:46.138
What?

21:46.221 --> 21:48.515
Let's just say
he's a lot crazier than you thought.

21:51.226 --> 21:54.563
Funny. I had no idea
that you'd actually see him again.

21:54.646 --> 21:56.565
I guess all that practice really paid off.

21:57.316 --> 21:58.525
I'm getting dizzy.

21:59.651 --> 22:02.404
I can't believe I thought I could
just talk to him. I must be crazy.

22:02.988 --> 22:05.240
- What have I been thinking?
- Why, what's wrong?

22:05.324 --> 22:08.493
It's just, I had to see him
regarding this work proposal.

22:10.537 --> 22:11.872
Forget it.

22:11.955 --> 22:13.957
Not like I'm getting anywhere
with that lost cause.

22:14.041 --> 22:15.334
See you around.

22:18.003 --> 22:18.837
Oh.

22:19.838 --> 22:21.923
Oh, my God, I'm such a ditz.

22:22.007 --> 22:23.759
We haven't seen each other
in ages, have we?

22:25.052 --> 22:27.471
How have you been doing, Kim Ji-ung?

22:41.860 --> 22:43.445
Was I too harsh with the salt?

22:55.123 --> 22:57.417
Grandma, wake up, let's eat.

22:58.460 --> 23:00.921
Oh, that was quick.

23:01.004 --> 23:02.964
Is it already dinner time?

23:03.048 --> 23:04.966
Uh-huh, eat up and go to bed.

23:05.801 --> 23:06.885
What time is it?

23:07.594 --> 23:10.097
Oh, I need to stay up for the drama,
I don't wanna miss it.

23:10.180 --> 23:12.057
They're not on yet. You have time to eat.

23:13.600 --> 23:16.978
How could someone
be so beautiful and have glowing skin?

23:17.979 --> 23:21.942
Oh, come on, grandma,
I just washed my face. That's all.

23:22.526 --> 23:25.070
Lately I've been seeing her
on TV more often.

23:25.153 --> 23:27.322
How could her face be so tiny?

23:27.406 --> 23:29.908
It's like she was blessed
by the angels themselves.

23:30.992 --> 23:34.204
Grandma, who do you think's prettier?
Her or me?

23:34.287 --> 23:36.081
- What are you going on about?
- Huh?

23:36.164 --> 23:37.916
You're really starting
to hurt my feelings over here.

23:37.999 --> 23:40.210
I'm your actual granddaughter,
she's a stranger on TV.

23:40.794 --> 23:42.629
And most likely she has a grandma too.

23:42.712 --> 23:44.673
What? What kind
of ridiculous answer is that?

23:44.756 --> 23:45.674
Did you even hear me?

23:45.757 --> 23:48.427
The perfect answer
to your absurd question, that's what.

23:48.510 --> 23:50.429
Now eat up
before the food gets cold.

23:50.512 --> 23:51.638
Unbelievable.

23:51.721 --> 23:53.515
I can't believe
I have your exact personality.

23:53.598 --> 23:55.976
That's why
I'm so hot-tempered around everyone.

23:56.059 --> 23:58.353
Good. Being hot-tempered
is a must if you're poor.

23:58.437 --> 24:00.021
Don't let others look down on you. Okay?

24:01.982 --> 24:05.235
I guess I've been
a little too kind these days, haven't I?

24:05.318 --> 24:07.362
Maybe that's why I've been feeling like
I've been dragged

24:07.446 --> 24:09.990
- around lately.
- You what? Who's been treating you wrong?

24:10.073 --> 24:13.034
Who was it? Who made
my granddaughter feel all down and sad?

24:13.118 --> 24:14.995
Take me to that scumbag.

24:15.078 --> 24:16.913
You bring all those bastards
to me right now.

24:16.997 --> 24:19.374
I'm gonna teach those brats
a lesson they'll never forget.

24:19.458 --> 24:21.710
- When I'm through with them--
- You're definitely my grandma.

24:24.379 --> 24:26.006
You just grab this black part…

24:26.089 --> 24:28.300
- Okay.
- …and push it in. It's very simple, right?

24:28.383 --> 24:31.261
- All right, I got it. Yeah.
- Now go bring it outside.

24:31.344 --> 24:33.430
All right. Yup.

24:43.482 --> 24:44.691
Excuse me, sir.

24:44.774 --> 24:47.486
- Two dark beers for table five, please.
- Sure. Hold on, wait.

24:47.569 --> 24:50.238
Once you're done with that,
just go home. You're all done here now.

24:50.322 --> 24:52.157
Why do you keep coming here
and helping us out?

24:52.240 --> 24:53.617
You're making me feel guilty.

24:53.700 --> 24:56.161
You've been giving me an allowance.
I should do something in return.

24:56.244 --> 24:57.913
And I'm saying you don't have to.

24:59.623 --> 25:01.791
Excuse me, sir,
two more beers over here, please.

25:01.875 --> 25:03.126
Oh, sure.

25:07.172 --> 25:09.508
- Excuse me.
- Yes, just one minute.

25:11.343 --> 25:14.846
Here are your dark beers.
Two of them. Enjoy your dinner.

25:14.930 --> 25:16.306
Yes, what would you like, ma'am?

25:16.389 --> 25:18.600
- One half-and-half spicy chicken.
- Okay.

25:19.184 --> 25:20.268
And then one chicken salad.

25:20.352 --> 25:21.561
Mm…

25:21.645 --> 25:24.189
One tteokbokki, chicken feet fried rice.

25:24.272 --> 25:25.398
- And this one as well.
- Okay, sure.

25:26.358 --> 25:28.068
Sorry, are you gonna drink those?

25:28.818 --> 25:30.070
Yeah, I will.

25:30.153 --> 25:31.780
I'll go and get your order ready.

25:37.285 --> 25:39.371
Your food is here, ma'am.
Thank you for waiting.

25:40.121 --> 25:42.541
Tteokbokki and chicken feet friend rice.

25:43.875 --> 25:45.418
You sure you can finish all that?

25:45.919 --> 25:48.338
Sorry? Why would you even ask me that?

25:48.421 --> 25:50.423
Of course I can, don't worry.
I'll finish all of it.

25:50.507 --> 25:52.217
Hmm. Here's why.

25:52.300 --> 25:53.593
This one is on the house, ma'am.

25:53.677 --> 25:55.595
These are our crispy tenders.

25:55.679 --> 25:59.057
It's our brand new dish, and it's
the most popular one this month, so enjoy.

25:59.140 --> 26:00.225
Really? Are you sure

26:00.308 --> 26:01.726
- you're giving this for free?
- Of course.

26:01.810 --> 26:04.938
Seeing how much you've ordered,
I can tell these dishes are really good.

26:05.021 --> 26:06.565
Do you have a mukbang channel?

26:06.648 --> 26:09.150
Oh, I think I've seen you
in an online video before.

26:09.234 --> 26:12.821
No, you're mistaken. But thanks anyway.

26:12.904 --> 26:14.614
- Opened a business nearby?
- Yes. What?

26:14.698 --> 26:15.657
It's okay.

26:16.241 --> 26:18.326
It's not a bad thing to size
your rivals up. It's pretty normal.

26:18.410 --> 26:20.829
If you look around,
many of our customers are just like you.

26:20.912 --> 26:22.539
I saw you writing down
something on a notepad.

26:22.622 --> 26:23.707
What did you write?

26:25.333 --> 26:28.545
Where's your business located?
What's it called? A restaurant? A bar?

26:28.628 --> 26:30.046
I said that you're mistaken.

26:30.130 --> 26:31.881
I don't know
why you're asking me all this.

26:31.965 --> 26:34.676
Why do you have to make me
uncomfortable about ordering so much food?

26:34.759 --> 26:37.137
You see, I'm extremely close
with the owner of this place.

26:37.220 --> 26:40.682
- I can ask him the recipes for you.
- Oh, my God, can you really…

26:40.765 --> 26:42.892
No, why would I want that?

26:42.976 --> 26:46.271
You're wrong about me. What time is it?
I should get going, it's getting late.

26:47.147 --> 26:49.566
- I'd like to pay the bill.
- What about all this food?

26:49.649 --> 26:51.818
You're not eating? If you want
I can pack them to-go for you.

26:52.319 --> 26:54.487
Yes. You can do that.

26:54.571 --> 26:55.530
I'm glad.

26:55.614 --> 26:58.908
I hope you savor the food slowly and
eventually find out what the recipes are.

26:58.992 --> 26:59.993
Good luck.

27:03.705 --> 27:04.831
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

27:11.838 --> 27:15.342
"Super tasty, extremely tasty,
incredibly tasty."

27:15.425 --> 27:16.885
Her business is gonna go under.

27:30.023 --> 27:31.191
Hey.

27:31.733 --> 27:34.861
Why are you sleeping so pitifully?
You're already pitiful, to begin with.

27:34.944 --> 27:37.155
I couldn't sleep well this morning.

27:37.238 --> 27:38.990
I heard Yeon-su came by.

27:39.074 --> 27:40.408
Get that away. It's blinding me.

27:42.202 --> 27:44.371
- How did you know?
- I ran into her earlier.

27:45.705 --> 27:47.832
Was it before or after we met?

27:47.916 --> 27:49.334
After you threw salt at her.

27:49.417 --> 27:50.877
Did she tell you that?

27:51.461 --> 27:52.545
No, she didn't have to.

27:52.629 --> 27:54.756
I know you've been
rehearsing that for years.

27:54.839 --> 27:56.049
Have you gone insane?

27:56.132 --> 27:59.302
You're the one who was acting weird and
yet I'm the one who's feeling embarrassed.

28:02.555 --> 28:04.307
I had no idea I'd see her again.

28:05.934 --> 28:07.394
What's it like seeing her again?

28:08.728 --> 28:11.314
Don't know.
Don't even remember what I said.

28:11.398 --> 28:13.858
Well, I bet you said
all sorts of outrageous things.

28:13.942 --> 28:17.070
Hey. Did you come over here
to pick a fight?

28:21.366 --> 28:23.910
What? What're you so curious about?

28:23.993 --> 28:25.286
Well, let's see…

28:25.370 --> 28:27.038
Just wondering what your mental age is.

28:27.122 --> 28:28.331
Oh, stop that.

28:31.042 --> 28:33.044
Hey. By the way,

28:33.128 --> 28:35.338
was there anything else she say?
About anything.

28:36.339 --> 28:37.590
- Hm?
- Not much.

28:39.175 --> 28:40.719
I see.

28:46.599 --> 28:47.976
Let's go inside. It's chilly.

28:50.103 --> 28:51.354
Actually, I'm going home.

28:52.564 --> 28:55.567
What? What did you come over here for?

28:55.650 --> 28:57.152
Beats me.

28:57.944 --> 28:58.903
Bye.

29:13.168 --> 29:14.335
Beats me.

29:18.047 --> 29:19.841
Hey, grandma, I'm heading out.

29:19.924 --> 29:21.301
Remember what I told you.

29:21.384 --> 29:24.053
If anyone looks down on you…

29:24.637 --> 29:26.264
Don't you worry,
I'm never gonna forget that.

29:28.057 --> 29:30.769
She made everything simpler.
Everything's clearer now.

29:31.770 --> 29:33.730
I should tell them the truth
and not be dispirited.

29:33.813 --> 29:35.565
- Hello, how you doing?
- Then fix the issue.

29:36.816 --> 29:39.277
Ms. Kook, you're looking like
you're in a very good mood today.

29:39.360 --> 29:40.403
Is that so?

29:40.945 --> 29:42.822
I'll tell him
that I can't get Go-oh,

29:42.906 --> 29:45.200
and then I'm gonna propose
an outstanding alternative.

29:45.283 --> 29:47.035
I'll show him
what I've got and impress him.

29:47.118 --> 29:48.703
He won't know what hit him
when I'm through.

29:48.787 --> 29:50.705
Oh, and Mr. Bang is just with--

29:50.789 --> 29:52.207
Hey, Ms. Kook, you're here.

29:53.374 --> 29:56.795
Oh, Mr. Jang Do-yul paid us a visit
early in the morning today.

29:56.878 --> 29:59.214
I heard the project is going well.
We were discussing it.

30:00.465 --> 30:02.425
So much
for showing him what I've got.

30:02.509 --> 30:04.719
Seems like you clock in
very late in the day, Ms. Kook.

30:05.553 --> 30:07.597
No, that's not it.

30:07.680 --> 30:08.723
All of this is on purpose.

30:08.807 --> 30:11.476
For a more creative vibe,
our workers clock in whenever they want.

30:11.559 --> 30:13.269
It gives them more productive freedom.

30:13.353 --> 30:16.272
After all, creativity stems
from a great work environment.

30:16.356 --> 30:17.440
Sorry, I wasn't prepared.

30:17.524 --> 30:20.193
I didn't expect to see you here
so early in the morning.

30:20.276 --> 30:22.028
We have numerous
important matters to discuss,

30:22.111 --> 30:24.239
and I'd like to attend
Soen Shop's soft launch together.

30:24.322 --> 30:25.740
To gain perspective on our approach.

30:25.824 --> 30:27.992
All right.
Come with me, sir. I'll fill you in.

30:28.076 --> 30:28.952
I think I'll go with Ms. Kook.

30:29.035 --> 30:31.162
After all, isn't she the one
overseeing this entire project?

30:31.746 --> 30:33.873
Exactly, I agree. Going there
with a hands-on staff would be

30:33.957 --> 30:36.417
the most efficient way of doing things.
What are you still doing there?

30:36.501 --> 30:38.753
- Hurry up and go with him already.
- Yes, um…

30:43.383 --> 30:46.177
Fantastic,
something I'm not prepared for.

30:52.517 --> 30:54.894
Uh, Mr. Jang, sir?

30:55.812 --> 30:59.357
I was wondering,
did you get home safe that night?

31:03.987 --> 31:05.196
By any chance…

31:06.698 --> 31:07.991
do you not remember what happened?

31:09.492 --> 31:10.326
Sorry?

31:20.420 --> 31:21.379
Ms. Kook, wait.

31:22.714 --> 31:24.716
I think you're a little too drunk,
so slow down and--

31:24.799 --> 31:27.635
I told you. I don't get drunk easily.

31:28.177 --> 31:31.431
Why would you even think
I'd be that way after I…

31:31.514 --> 31:33.808
I'd appreciate it if you walked
in a straight line for a minute.

31:33.892 --> 31:36.936
Why aren't you using your umbrella?
Can't you see it's pouring out here?

31:37.020 --> 31:38.062
Umbrella?

31:39.105 --> 31:40.064
I…

31:40.690 --> 31:41.983
I don't…

31:43.318 --> 31:46.362
I don't have an umbrella.

31:47.322 --> 31:51.284
Unfortunately, I don't have one!

31:52.243 --> 31:54.662
I don't have an umbrella…

31:54.746 --> 31:58.166
Oh, my God, my umbrella…

32:01.502 --> 32:05.882
What… what is this flashback?
Why am I remembering this?

32:15.642 --> 32:16.809
Are you getting out?

32:17.685 --> 32:20.021
Yes. I am, thanks.

32:24.108 --> 32:25.193
Let's use my car.

32:26.152 --> 32:27.236
Okay.

32:51.135 --> 32:53.096
Excuse me, Mr. Jang.

32:53.179 --> 32:54.555
Yes, Ms. Kook, what is it?

32:54.639 --> 32:57.016
You won't believe what's happening.

32:57.100 --> 33:00.979
Someone is stealing your car
right now. Call the cops.

33:03.815 --> 33:06.442
He's not stealing it.
He's actually driving the car for me.

33:06.526 --> 33:09.112
Don't worry about a thing, Mr. Jang.

33:09.195 --> 33:12.156
I'll keep a close eye on him,
so he won't get away.

33:13.116 --> 33:14.784
Okay. Thank you very much.

33:14.867 --> 33:16.786
Is she… is she gonna be okay?

33:16.869 --> 33:18.705
Excuse me!

33:19.205 --> 33:21.207
You need to watch it.

33:21.290 --> 33:23.835
Mr. Jang has a nasty temper.

33:23.918 --> 33:25.878
He's not gonna show any mercy.

33:26.796 --> 33:28.798
Now I think
you're just deliberately bashing me.

33:35.596 --> 33:37.598
You're awfully quiet today, Ms. Kook.

33:38.891 --> 33:41.352
- Sorry?
- What's the matter? Remembering something?

33:42.186 --> 33:46.274
Not at all. I'm afraid I have no idea
what you're talking about. Nope.

33:47.358 --> 33:49.235
I think you know what it is.

33:49.318 --> 33:50.862
No, I don't understand. What you mean?

33:50.945 --> 33:52.697
How much do you remember from that night?

33:52.780 --> 33:54.949
Do you remember mumbling
and ranting about anything at all?

33:55.033 --> 33:56.826
Or calling me a sociopath?

33:56.909 --> 33:57.910
What?

34:01.414 --> 34:04.459
You think you're a sociopath.

34:04.959 --> 34:05.960
Sorry?

34:07.420 --> 34:11.132
You're a frigid, cold-hearted man

34:11.215 --> 34:13.551
who will walk all over anyone

34:13.634 --> 34:16.596
in his way to achieve success.

34:17.805 --> 34:19.182
You sure you're talking about me?

34:19.265 --> 34:22.894
"I may not be able
to empathize with others,

34:22.977 --> 34:27.607
but I'm a cold-hearted man
who's intelligent and good at his job."

34:28.608 --> 34:29.859
Ms. Kook. I don't think--

34:29.942 --> 34:31.444
Unbelievable.

34:32.445 --> 34:34.280
TVs really can throw you off.

34:34.363 --> 34:37.992
They have a distorted image of people
instead of the truth.

34:38.076 --> 34:40.536
My grandma and I watch this drama,

34:40.620 --> 34:43.039
there's this character
who's exactly like you.

34:44.165 --> 34:45.833
People think they're cool,

34:45.917 --> 34:49.003
but in reality,
they're all a bunch of losers.

34:49.087 --> 34:51.339
Fake ass bastards.

34:51.923 --> 34:54.133
Ms. Kook, please.
Don't say anything you'll regret--

34:54.217 --> 34:58.221
No! I wasn't finished!
Stop cutting me off. Will you?

34:59.180 --> 35:03.351
Why do you keep cutting me off?
It's really very rude of you.

35:04.352 --> 35:08.231
How would you like it
if I cut your neck off?

35:21.369 --> 35:22.620
Mr. Jang, I'm sorry.

35:22.703 --> 35:25.498
I sincerely apologize
for everything I said that night.

35:25.581 --> 35:26.457
I'm truly sorry.

35:26.541 --> 35:28.543
So you remember
everything up to that point.

35:29.043 --> 35:30.878
I am extremely sorry.

35:31.462 --> 35:33.256
I am… I don't have any excuses.

35:33.339 --> 35:34.841
I was drunk and I made a huge--

35:34.924 --> 35:37.844
I thought you never got drunk.
That was an incredible display.

35:40.471 --> 35:43.891
Okay. Is there anything
that I can I do for you to forgive me?

35:44.392 --> 35:48.229
No, it's fine. Please just make sure
this upcoming project goes smoothly.

35:49.772 --> 35:51.858
- Well, you see, that's…
- We're here now.

35:58.990 --> 36:01.325
Ung. Hey!

36:03.744 --> 36:06.789
- Ung.
- You startled me.

36:06.873 --> 36:09.208
- I just fell asleep. What is it?
- What's this, huh?

36:10.459 --> 36:11.502
What about it?

36:12.336 --> 36:14.881
What is this? I saw it on the table.
Who gave this to you?

36:14.964 --> 36:16.966
Oh, that? Yeon-su gave it to me.

36:17.049 --> 36:18.634
Yeon-su did? No way.

36:18.718 --> 36:20.803
You're telling me this is what she does?

36:20.887 --> 36:23.764
More importantly,
is this the reason she came to see you?

36:23.848 --> 36:24.765
Unbelievable.

36:24.849 --> 36:27.226
Oh, so that's why
she went all the way here.

36:27.310 --> 36:29.228
Makes sense. It's not like
she would've stooped so low

36:29.312 --> 36:30.897
just to come back to see you, would she?

36:30.980 --> 36:32.690
- Right?
- What are you talking about?

36:32.773 --> 36:35.067
- You take her up on it?
- I didn't. I refused.

36:35.151 --> 36:37.236
Are you crazy? Why would you do that?

36:38.487 --> 36:39.864
Did you even read any of it?

36:40.907 --> 36:42.491
No. Why should I?

36:42.575 --> 36:43.409
I don't wanna do it.

36:43.492 --> 36:45.328
She talked about doing
some live show or something

36:45.411 --> 36:48.539
so I flatly rejected her right away.
You know I don't do those kinds of things.

36:48.623 --> 36:50.625
But, you'll be, you'll be drawing
Soen Shop. It's Soen Shop.

36:50.708 --> 36:51.918
So? What is that?

36:53.669 --> 36:56.881
It's a new shop that has launched
in Paris, London, and now over here.

36:56.964 --> 36:59.258
Are you nuts?
You should've said yes immediately.

36:59.342 --> 37:02.011
This is a great opportunity.
You of all people should be doing this.

37:02.094 --> 37:03.095
Why should I?

37:04.722 --> 37:07.350
Because Jean Ferrat
designed the damn building. Look.

37:09.435 --> 37:12.438
How did you not know
your favorite architect was involved?

37:12.521 --> 37:13.773
Get off your ass.

37:13.856 --> 37:16.359
Go to Yeon-su this instant and tell her
that, "Fine, you're gonna do it."

37:16.442 --> 37:18.778
Why did you have to act all tough
and throw salt at her?

37:18.861 --> 37:20.446
You're an idiot. You messed up.

37:21.572 --> 37:22.740
Now go over there and beg for it.

37:22.823 --> 37:24.075
WORLD-FAMOUS ARCHITECT, JEAN FERRAT

37:27.453 --> 37:28.829
Damn it. I won't do it.

37:29.997 --> 37:32.124
Now I know you're crazy.
You're really opting out of this?

37:33.542 --> 37:36.337
Okay. Wait there.
Let me show you the Soen Shop.

37:38.047 --> 37:39.590
SOEN SHOP

37:40.549 --> 37:43.219
Oh? They're having a soft launch today.

37:44.720 --> 37:45.763
Today?

37:46.847 --> 37:50.518
Let's go. Just go take a look, Ung,
I bet it will change your mind.

37:55.564 --> 37:57.733
NJ. One hour before rehearsals.

37:57.817 --> 37:58.901
Please ready everything.

37:58.985 --> 38:01.696
Okay, will do.
Hey, everyone, let's get ready, come on!

38:01.779 --> 38:03.322
Why hasn't he called me?

38:03.406 --> 38:04.907
Who?

38:04.991 --> 38:06.450
You know, that artist.

38:06.534 --> 38:09.954
- Did he say that he'd call you?
- Yeah. I asked him to do me a favor.

38:10.037 --> 38:11.580
He said he'd think about it
and give me a call.

38:12.164 --> 38:13.457
How long has it been?

38:15.543 --> 38:17.211
About a day and three hours?

38:17.295 --> 38:19.630
Come on.
And here I thought it was a big deal.

38:19.714 --> 38:21.173
To you, it's not, but to me, it is.

38:22.091 --> 38:24.385
He's an artist.
And a pretty famous one at that.

38:24.468 --> 38:26.387
These people,
they have a certain way of thinking.

38:27.096 --> 38:30.391
He probably thinks you're a snob,
so he's cautiously taking his time.

38:31.267 --> 38:33.477
No, that can't be the reason why.

38:33.561 --> 38:34.812
Wait, is he handsome?

38:35.855 --> 38:38.190
Not really. Actually…

38:40.776 --> 38:42.445
He kinda looks like an idiot.

38:42.528 --> 38:45.865
Well, well, well, exactly your type.

38:45.948 --> 38:47.283
Exactly, I know.

38:47.366 --> 38:50.536
Here's someone who's exactly my type,
and he's not even messaging me.

38:54.540 --> 38:56.292
Chi-seong. Is my schedule today--

38:56.375 --> 38:59.003
No, it's full.
It's completely packed.

39:00.421 --> 39:02.840
- Can I skip any one of them?
- No, you can't.

39:02.923 --> 39:05.843
See, what's happening is you're making up
for what you skipped the past two weeks,

39:05.926 --> 39:07.595
so that's definitely not an option.

39:07.678 --> 39:10.848
NJ. I can see that
you're racking your brain again

39:10.931 --> 39:11.891
over something unimportant.

39:11.974 --> 39:14.852
Can you please not do that, for now, hm?

39:14.935 --> 39:17.021
- For my sake.
- Do you think I should call him first?

39:17.104 --> 39:19.106
No, I can't.

39:19.899 --> 39:23.277
Even if he's ordinary,
I've reached out to him too often already.

39:24.028 --> 39:27.865
Actually, since he's an artist,
I guess he's kind of a celebrity too.

39:28.783 --> 39:30.826
So it's no big deal if I call him first.

39:42.380 --> 39:43.339
Are you going to do it?

39:45.424 --> 39:48.427
- No, I'm not. Why?
- Then why keep watching?

39:48.511 --> 39:51.764
- Because…
- If you ask me, it looks kinda fun.

39:54.517 --> 39:55.351
Why?

39:55.851 --> 39:58.354
Look at them.
They're so lively, flopping around.

39:58.437 --> 39:59.897
What are they like fish or something?

40:01.232 --> 40:03.859
I like their chemistry
and distinct characters.

40:03.943 --> 40:05.945
It's perfect
for the early summertime.

40:06.028 --> 40:07.321
They're awkward, young and full of energy.

40:08.155 --> 40:11.367
It's a youth documentary
that's more exciting than most dramas.

40:12.159 --> 40:14.453
I guess it's childish, but it also
talks about the issues

40:14.537 --> 40:16.122
kids their age worry about, so,

40:16.205 --> 40:17.957
I could understand
why the viewers loved it

40:18.040 --> 40:20.209
and why they would wanna
see them again after some time.

40:20.292 --> 40:22.753
All they did was
argue and fight the whole time?

40:22.837 --> 40:24.463
Did you also watch the original?

40:24.547 --> 40:26.298
Take a look when you have time,
you might change your mind.

40:26.382 --> 40:29.718
The original?
When were you even able to watch that?

40:29.802 --> 40:32.430
You were also in it.
I remember seeing you a lot.

40:32.513 --> 40:35.683
- You were rather cute when you were 19.
- Yeah, whatever.

40:36.308 --> 40:37.518
Anyway, take a look at it.

40:38.853 --> 40:40.938
No, thanks. Don't have any time for that.

40:41.021 --> 40:43.357
I'm heading off to shoot some footage.

40:43.441 --> 40:44.442
Bye.

40:52.116 --> 40:53.325
EDITING ROOM

41:11.510 --> 41:14.180
Why the hell am I doing this?

41:15.931 --> 41:17.099
SBC SPECIAL

41:53.761 --> 41:55.679
Once we remove the barricades
on the opening day,

41:55.763 --> 41:58.015
there won't be enough room.
You should consider that too.

41:58.098 --> 42:00.476
- Okay.
- Hello. Over here this way. I'll show you.

42:02.645 --> 42:04.271
Since the showroom is on the third floor,

42:04.355 --> 42:06.398
the guest should
take a tour through here first.

42:06.482 --> 42:08.108
I'll send you an email about it later.

42:08.192 --> 42:10.444
Should I put these items
where they can be more visible?

42:10.528 --> 42:11.612
So the guests can see them?

42:14.782 --> 42:15.950
Mr. Jang?

42:17.618 --> 42:18.577
Okay.

42:20.579 --> 42:21.664
They're nice.

42:24.750 --> 42:27.169
What now?
You still don't wanna do it?

42:28.295 --> 42:30.923
Go inside and you'll change your mind,
I'm telling you.

42:37.221 --> 42:38.639
- Oh. I'm sorry sir.
- Yes?

42:38.722 --> 42:41.267
The technicians are taking turns
inspecting the elevators.

42:41.350 --> 42:43.561
- It'll take about 15 minutes more.
- No, that's fine.

42:43.644 --> 42:44.979
We'll just take the escalator.

42:45.062 --> 42:46.021
Let's go.

42:49.858 --> 42:51.944
Our key features in the store
are furniture and lighting,

42:52.027 --> 42:54.113
put them at the top
of the product placement list

42:54.196 --> 42:55.197
when you create the plan.

42:55.281 --> 42:56.615
Also, please make sure that we'll utilize

42:57.199 --> 43:00.661
all the areas within the shop
as much as possible for publicity.

43:00.744 --> 43:03.038
And please make a list of products
we can place in media,

43:03.122 --> 43:05.666
that can be shown in dramas,
variety shows, or documentaries.

43:05.749 --> 43:06.875
Yes, sir, will do.

43:06.959 --> 43:08.085
Oh and by the way,

43:08.168 --> 43:11.005
- about that collaboration--
- Yo, Yeon-su! What's up?

43:18.596 --> 43:21.473
Okay, we'll go up there to you.
Just stay there. Wait for us.

43:23.183 --> 43:24.268
I'm so sorry.

43:25.227 --> 43:27.313
It's okay, it's fine.
Do you need some privacy?

43:27.396 --> 43:29.607
Oh, no, you can continue, please.

43:31.775 --> 43:33.110
I think she's over there.

43:33.193 --> 43:34.486
- Oh! Yeon-su!
- What are you doing?

43:34.570 --> 43:35.404
There you are.

43:36.363 --> 43:37.906
- Hands off.
- I dragged him all the way here.

43:37.990 --> 43:38.949
Aren't you glad?

43:39.033 --> 43:41.452
Yeah, now please
drag him out of here, right now.

43:42.036 --> 43:43.287
FYI, I didn't wanna come here.

43:43.370 --> 43:46.040
I heard you wanted to work with him,
so I thought we'd meet up and hash--

43:47.249 --> 43:48.876
You might as well tell everyone.

43:52.880 --> 43:54.798
Eun-ho, I'm in the middle
of work right now.

43:54.882 --> 43:57.635
It's okay, Ms. Kook, I can give you
some privacy I'll just wait down--

43:57.718 --> 43:58.886
Oh, no, that's okay. Just stay.

43:59.928 --> 44:03.807
Excuse me, but are you like a friend
of Yeon-su or are you working with her?

44:04.642 --> 44:07.686
Actually, he's the marketing team leader
of the Soen Shop company.

44:07.770 --> 44:09.521
No way.

44:09.605 --> 44:12.191
What a coincidence, 'cause we're
very interested in this place.

44:12.274 --> 44:14.401
Ung, heard that?
He's the marketing team leader.

44:14.485 --> 44:16.070
Stop embarrassing me.
Let's get out of here.

44:16.153 --> 44:17.321
This is only our soft launch,

44:17.404 --> 44:19.114
as you can see it's still hectic
around the whole building.

44:19.198 --> 44:21.617
But I hope you enjoy it anyway.
Oh, if you're unsatisfied

44:21.700 --> 44:22.993
or if you have any suggestions for us,

44:23.494 --> 44:25.537
please feel free to tell our workers
on your way out.

44:25.621 --> 44:26.705
Yeah, sure. Definitely.

44:26.789 --> 44:28.916
Wow. You're very friendly.
I'm never gonna forget you.

44:29.541 --> 44:31.043
Yeon-su, don't forget
to call me when you're done,

44:31.126 --> 44:33.462
and we'll talk about the deal.
My number is…

44:33.545 --> 44:34.755
Never mind. Just call Ung directly.

44:34.838 --> 44:36.674
- Come on.
- Make sure you call him when you're free.

44:36.757 --> 44:38.717
Don't forget to call us, okay, huh?

44:41.220 --> 44:42.596
I'm so sorry about that, sir.

44:42.680 --> 44:45.099
No, it's okay. They're interesting people.

44:49.311 --> 44:50.562
What's the matter?

44:51.480 --> 44:55.109
Uh, honestly I'm just a little surprised
that you weren't offended by--

44:55.192 --> 44:57.528
Oh, because I didn't act
like a sociopath this time?

44:57.611 --> 45:00.114
Oh, no. That's not why.

45:00.197 --> 45:02.032
- Let's go.
- Okay.

45:05.786 --> 45:06.829
Wow.

45:08.122 --> 45:10.040
That team leader
has a handsome face.

45:10.124 --> 45:12.209
How can a marketing guy
be so damn good-looking?

45:13.335 --> 45:14.920
Seriously, if I didn't know who they were,

45:15.003 --> 45:16.839
they look like a couple
when they're together.

45:19.174 --> 45:22.136
Hey. How could you talk about me
in front of everyone as my manager?

45:22.219 --> 45:24.680
Oh, come on. Who do you think
you are? Batman or something?

45:24.763 --> 45:27.558
Why are you so desperate to hide?
We didn't tell the whole world.

45:27.641 --> 45:29.685
- Shut up.
- Hold up. You're leaving already?

45:29.768 --> 45:31.937
You're not going
to talk to Yeon-su about the thing?

45:32.020 --> 45:33.355
I'm going for a walk upstairs.

45:34.857 --> 45:37.943
Look at you. You're totally
into this place, aren't you?

45:39.778 --> 45:42.531
NJ, deep breath at the count of two.

45:42.614 --> 45:44.575
One, two, now.

45:46.910 --> 45:48.954
Done. Okay. Great.

45:50.456 --> 45:52.583
Okay.

45:52.666 --> 45:54.418
- Unzip me right now.
- What? Why?

45:54.501 --> 45:56.545
- Hurry up. Do it.
- Hold on, all right.

45:56.628 --> 45:58.756
There we go. Why? What's wrong?

45:58.839 --> 45:59.840
MR. CHOI UNG
READ

46:00.424 --> 46:01.383
Are you crazy?

46:02.134 --> 46:04.011
How dare you ignore my text?

46:04.094 --> 46:05.137
The artist?

46:05.220 --> 46:07.431
Looks like you've met your match.

46:09.349 --> 46:11.101
He's probably writing his reply.

46:11.185 --> 46:13.020
He's just being
meticulous and prudent, right?

46:13.103 --> 46:14.354
How long has it been?

46:15.147 --> 46:16.190
Thirteen minutes?

46:16.273 --> 46:18.609
I really don't get
young people like you these days.

46:18.692 --> 46:20.527
It's only been 13 short minutes.

46:20.611 --> 46:22.362
You have the patience of a child.

46:23.238 --> 46:25.824
Then again, he didn't strike me
as the prudent type.

46:25.908 --> 46:27.618
Why does he keep ignoring me?

46:31.205 --> 46:32.581
Take it off, I'm not gonna use it.

46:33.081 --> 46:34.041
- Chi-seong.
- Yes?

46:34.124 --> 46:35.626
She's at it again. Please talk to her.

46:35.709 --> 46:38.295
What? What is it this time? Tell me.

46:38.378 --> 46:40.672
I can skip the rehearsal.
I don't need to do it.

46:40.756 --> 46:42.090
I need to go out for a bit.

46:56.104 --> 46:57.689
Sir, I have to tell you something.

46:58.190 --> 47:00.400
It's about the opening event plan.

47:00.484 --> 47:02.611
Go ahead, I'm listening.

47:02.694 --> 47:06.198
You know that plan about the collaboration
with the artist I told you about?

47:06.281 --> 47:07.324
Yes.

47:08.158 --> 47:10.452
I don't think it'll pan out anymore.

47:13.121 --> 47:14.248
Why not?

47:14.331 --> 47:16.750
I wasn't able to contact him
no matter how hard I tried.

47:16.834 --> 47:18.752
And through my extensive research on him,

47:18.836 --> 47:22.005
we hit a roadblock. I found out that
he doesn't want to be seen in public.

47:24.466 --> 47:26.718
- Ms. Kook, listen--
- I know you're disappointed about this.

47:26.802 --> 47:28.136
However, I'm truly sorry.

47:28.220 --> 47:30.806
In any case, I promise
that I'll come up with something else.

47:30.889 --> 47:32.182
A better alternative.

47:35.143 --> 47:37.437
I guess you really don't remember
what happened at the end.

47:37.521 --> 47:38.355
What?

47:38.438 --> 47:40.524
You remember up until
you called me a sociopath,

47:40.607 --> 47:41.441
but it didn't end there.

47:41.525 --> 47:43.986
You don't remember about
what happened in front of your house?

47:44.695 --> 47:46.488
I don't get you.

47:54.746 --> 47:57.082
I found out who Go-oh is.

48:00.335 --> 48:03.338
Because I didn't want you
to look down on me.

48:04.423 --> 48:06.174
That's actually really great news.

48:06.884 --> 48:09.261
I really hoped it wasn't him.

48:10.345 --> 48:13.265
I really didn't expect it to be him.

48:14.349 --> 48:15.392
Sorry?

48:15.475 --> 48:17.394
How do I do this…

48:17.477 --> 48:20.606
How can I possibly see him again?

48:23.150 --> 48:24.568
I don't get what you mean.

48:24.651 --> 48:27.487
How am I gonna handle it?

48:29.573 --> 48:33.785
Seeing that jerk, Choi Ung,
after all this time?

48:39.166 --> 48:40.500
You don't mean Go-oh, right?

48:41.335 --> 48:42.419
You personally know him?

48:43.587 --> 48:46.715
It's been five years
since we broke up.

48:50.010 --> 48:51.136
Hey.

48:52.429 --> 48:53.722
Hello, Ms. Kook?

48:53.805 --> 48:56.308
Out of everyone in the world…

48:58.268 --> 49:00.604
Why did it have to be Ung?

49:00.687 --> 49:02.898
How am I supposed to face him?

49:05.150 --> 49:07.194
What the? Son of a bitch!

49:07.277 --> 49:09.237
What in the world did I tell him?

49:16.495 --> 49:18.914
- That guy just now was Go-oh, wasn't he?
- You see--

49:18.997 --> 49:20.916
He seems to know
about this project.

49:20.999 --> 49:23.168
Okay, if you're uncomfortable
about working with him on this,

49:23.251 --> 49:26.338
we're willing to replace you with someone
who's more capable of handling it

49:26.421 --> 49:27.839
and proceed with the original plan.

49:27.923 --> 49:30.008
- But sir, it's--
- I'm saying, since you were in charge

49:30.092 --> 49:32.970
from the get-go it'd be great
if you stayed on board to see it through.

49:33.053 --> 49:36.139
However, we have no choice if you can't
put your personal feelings aside.

49:36.223 --> 49:37.724
- Mr. Jang.
- Just one minute.

49:37.808 --> 49:39.393
You're done for today, so you can leave.

49:39.476 --> 49:42.187
Let me know if anything comes up.
You have my number. Goodbye.

49:42.270 --> 49:43.939
- Yes?
- Can you check this?

49:44.022 --> 49:45.357
Oh, that looks fine.

49:48.944 --> 49:51.655
What should I do now?

49:56.868 --> 50:00.622
Oh, no. What am I supposed to do?

50:03.709 --> 50:04.960
Going in?

50:27.107 --> 50:28.150
Where is Eun-ho?

50:28.984 --> 50:30.152
Somewhere downstairs.

50:35.032 --> 50:36.450
Whoa.

50:38.201 --> 50:40.829
Right. They said they were
inspecting the elevators.

50:42.748 --> 50:43.749
EMERGENCY CALL

50:43.832 --> 50:46.251
We're stuck in elevator nine.
Please send assistance.

50:50.505 --> 50:53.467
- It won't take long, don't worry.
- You don't look too surprised.

50:53.550 --> 50:55.010
Is there a reason that I should be?

51:04.895 --> 51:07.522
Thought you said you weren't interested.
What changed?

51:07.606 --> 51:09.024
I read the proposal today.

51:09.107 --> 51:11.610
I knew it. You didn't even bother
reading it that day.

51:13.987 --> 51:16.990
It blows my mind. How are you
still so immature after all these years?

51:17.074 --> 51:19.576
With the water and the salt,
I heard you rehearsed that several times.

51:19.659 --> 51:22.454
- Did Ji-ung tell you that?
- Just grow up, will you?

51:22.537 --> 51:24.539
Seriously, that's all you could think of?

51:27.667 --> 51:28.960
What about you?

51:29.461 --> 51:31.630
Was that the only excuse
you could think of after five years?

51:39.221 --> 51:42.349
Then what excuse were you expecting
to hear when you saw me outside your door?

51:51.191 --> 51:54.402
One thing was for sure,
I wasn't gonna be childish like you.

51:54.486 --> 51:55.987
After all, it had been five years already.

52:02.786 --> 52:04.788
What if I had stopped behaving childishly?

52:07.499 --> 52:08.875
Would you have stayed with me?

52:17.425 --> 52:19.845
If you were being sincere back then,

52:19.928 --> 52:21.888
tell me, what would you have done?

52:38.530 --> 52:40.907
I'm sorry. They must have
made a mistake during the inspection.

52:40.991 --> 52:42.492
No, it's okay. Thank you.

53:00.552 --> 53:02.012
I really am childish.

53:03.221 --> 53:04.514
I just ran away.

53:14.357 --> 53:15.442
How's it going?

53:17.277 --> 53:18.278
Oh.

53:19.029 --> 53:20.697
NJ, hey, what are you doing here?

53:20.780 --> 53:23.241
- Do you know where your phone is?
- Where my phone is?

53:23.825 --> 53:25.076
It's right here in my pocket.

53:25.577 --> 53:28.455
Oh, so you didn't lose it after all.

53:28.538 --> 53:30.165
Then why have you been ignoring me?

53:30.790 --> 53:33.877
Oh, that. I turned it off
because I wanted a bit more time to think

53:33.960 --> 53:35.837
what I'd say to you,
you know, before replying.

53:35.921 --> 53:37.547
So you put off my text?

53:37.631 --> 53:40.008
I'm curious,
what were you doing that time?

53:40.091 --> 53:41.635
I was… I went out somewhere.

53:42.302 --> 53:44.554
What about you?
What are you doing around here?

53:44.638 --> 53:45.931
Do you have, like, an event here?

53:46.014 --> 53:48.934
No reason. I was just wondering
why you were ignoring me.

53:49.726 --> 53:52.854
But… aren't you really busy?
Don't you have a packed schedule?

53:53.355 --> 53:56.149
I do, I'll be leaving in five minutes.
I have a live stage scheduled.

53:56.233 --> 53:58.360
I just had a bit of free time to kill.

53:59.027 --> 54:01.738
- So you came here?
- I'm usually too busy to feel bored,

54:01.821 --> 54:03.823
fortunately, things have
changed a lot these days.

54:04.407 --> 54:08.578
I wanted to see what you were so busy with
instead of replying to my text.

54:08.662 --> 54:09.537
What?

54:10.330 --> 54:12.249
Um, you know, you're very…

54:14.125 --> 54:15.252
What should I say?

54:16.002 --> 54:17.128
I'll just use the word unique.

54:17.212 --> 54:18.630
I'm running late. You take care.

54:18.713 --> 54:21.466
Hold on, is that why you came
all the way out here? To check up on me?

54:21.549 --> 54:24.344
You wanna find out?
Easy, just ignore my text again.

54:24.928 --> 54:25.762
Let's go.

54:37.816 --> 54:39.109
SBC SPECIAL
HWIYEONG HIGH SCHOOL

54:45.073 --> 54:46.533
Hey! Whoa!

55:21.067 --> 55:21.985
Hello.

55:23.236 --> 55:25.613
Okay, I'll do it. I'm in.

57:14.556 --> 57:15.932
SBC SPECIAL

57:30.822 --> 57:32.615
What? What do you want me to do?

57:34.033 --> 57:35.535
- What?
- You don't have a choice.

57:36.953 --> 57:39.247
Don't annoy me so early in the morning.

57:40.248 --> 57:43.001
I need to do it, and that means so do you.

57:43.084 --> 57:45.420
- Does my Dad wanna film me too?
- No, that's not it.

57:46.296 --> 57:47.380
You and Yeon-su.

57:48.047 --> 57:50.633
Just like before. A documentary.

57:59.058 --> 58:00.977
Are you insane? What drugs are you on?

58:01.060 --> 58:03.271
Think I'm some kind
of a doormat you can step on?

58:05.148 --> 58:07.734
Hello everyone, I'm Choi Ung.
It's nice to meet you.

58:07.817 --> 58:09.194
EPILOGUE

58:10.528 --> 58:11.946
My name is…

58:15.950 --> 58:18.828
Are we seriously gonna do this again?

58:32.175 --> 58:39.182
1792 DAYS OF SUMMER

58:54.531 --> 58:56.783
Think about it, why would people
decide to star in a documentary?

58:56.866 --> 58:58.076
There's a good reason.

58:58.159 --> 58:59.869
My skin used to be so elastic.

59:01.120 --> 59:03.081
The things I hate?
Yeah, it's still Kook Yeon-su.

59:03.164 --> 59:06.125
To put Ung and Yeon-su together
after what they've been through…

59:06.209 --> 59:07.627
Wouldn't that be a little too disastrous?

59:07.710 --> 59:09.003
Wait. Wait. My crutch!

59:09.754 --> 59:12.966
Why would I?
You mean absolutely nothing to me. Zero.

59:13.049 --> 59:15.635
I've never met anyone so selfish,
she's so full of herself.

59:15.718 --> 59:17.220
All right,
let's see who wins this.

59:17.303 --> 59:20.974
How precious it is to be able to capture
and store a moment in your life.

59:21.057 --> 59:22.559
Just be honest with me.

59:22.642 --> 59:24.310
Does none of that
really mean anything to you?
